    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Final Answer Key 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-26T19:24:48+05:30\"\u003eMay 26, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e7:24 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\"\u003eStaff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the\u003cstrong\u003e Final Answer Key\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the Recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eDelhi Police Driver\u0026nbsp;Examination 2025.\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eExam\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003ewas conducted on\u003cstrong\u003e 16 – 17 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;The\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSSC\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;application process started on\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\"\u003e24 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\"\u003e15 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their \u003cstrong\u003eFinal Answer Key \u003c/strong\u003eusing their\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e by logging into the \u003cstrong\u003eportal. The direct link\u003c/strong\u003e is provided below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Final Answer Key 2026 – Out\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/ssc-delhi-police-driver-2025/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eApply Online Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e24 September 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eApply Online Last Date : \u003cstrong\u003e15 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cstrong\u003e16 October 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCorrection Date : \u003cstrong\u003e31 October – 02 November 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Date : \u003cstrong\u003e16 – 17 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam City Details : \u003cstrong\u003e14 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDecember 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAnswer Key : \u003cstrong\u003e31 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSlot Selection Starting Date\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e: 05 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSlot Selection Last Date\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e: 10 December 2025\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e29 April 2026 Available Now\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Delhi Police \u003c/strong\u003eofficial website.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eGeneral, OBC, EWS \u003c/strong\u003e:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e₹ 100/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eSC, ST, PWD Candidates\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e₹\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"blue bold\"\u003e00/-\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Notification 2025 : Age Limit As On 01 July 2025\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age :\u003cstrong\u003e 21 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age :\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e30 Years\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSSC\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eDelhi\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ePolice Driver \u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e660 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details \u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDelhi Police Driver\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e660\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDelhi Police Driver\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 65.0513%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidate must have passed the \u003cstrong data-start=\"171\" data-end=\"206\"\u003e10+2 (Intermediate) examination\u003c/strong\u003e from a recognized board or institution. In addition to the educational qualification, the candidate should possess a valid \u003cstrong\u003eHeavy Motor Vehicle (HMV) Driving License\u003c/strong\u003e, issued by a competent authority. Both conditions—academic qualification and driving license—are mandatory to be considered eligible for the post.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;SSC Delhi Police Driver Recruitment 2025 : PET Eligibility Details\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAge\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRace 1600 M\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Jump\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Jump\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eUp to 30 Years\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e07 Minutes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e12.6 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e3.6 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e30-40 Years\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e08 Minutes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e11.6 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e3.3 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 25px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAbove 40 Years\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e09 Minutes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e10.6 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 25%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e3.0 Feet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download SSC Delhi Police Driver Result 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"146\" data-end=\"226\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eVisit the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e of\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"181\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"whitespace-normal\"\u003eStaff Selection Commission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ywfl8p\" data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"281\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, go to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"271\"\u003e“Results”\u003c/strong\u003e section\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"18xygi9\" data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"319\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eClick on \u003cstrong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"313\"\u003e“Delhi Police”\u003c/strong\u003e tab\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u