\u003cstrong\u003eSSC Delhi Police Driver Result 2026?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The result is released by the \u003cstrong data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"238\"\u003eStaff Selection Commission (SSC)\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e For which post is \u003cstrong\u003ethis result issued?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e It is issued for the \u003cstrong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eDelhi Police Driver (Constable/Driver)\u003c/strong\u003e post.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the \u003cstrong\u003epurpose of the answer key?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The answer key helps candidates \u003cstrong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"468\"\u003echeck their answers\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"500\"\u003eestimate expected marks\u003c/strong\u003e before the result.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e In what format is the\u003cstrong\u003e result released?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The result is released in \u003cstrong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"625\"\u003eonline/PDF format\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website of the \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Delhi\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website of the \u003cstrong\u003eSSC Delhi \u003c/strong\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://ssc.gov.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-34196 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-04-30T114510.726-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"SSC Delhi Police Driver Result 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-04-30T114510.726-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-04-30T114510.726-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-04-30T114510.726-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-04-30T114510.726.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(